- Fix a vulnerability found by [Loupe](https://github.com/project-loupe/loupe) and, one day later, by [MrHodl](https://github.com/MrHodlX)
  The server stored all of a round's mailbox messages under one checkpoint.
  When two participations in a round shared a mailbox, every later read of
  that mailbox failed, including seed recovery. Each message now gets its own
  checkpoint.
  [#2790](https://gitlab.com/ark-bitcoin/bark/-/merge_requests/2790)
